      "id": "claim_84354b1df40844e392ea9ec3f9a6ac94",
      "statement": "Rule 600 and 610 underwriting controls are separate from HO-3 2024-03 post-loss duties: the form requires an insured to protect property and keep repair records, preserve and show damaged property, permit inspection, provide requested records and claim evidence, and submit to examination when reasonably requested; it separately requires requested inventories and ownership or lien information, while stating that an inspection is not acceptance of a condition or representation and is not a warranty that property is safe, sound, or compliant with law.",
